<title>USA: IDEXX acquires Taiwanese distributor.</title>
<headline>IDEXX acquires Taiwanese distributor.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBROOK, Maine 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDEXX Laboratories Inc said Tuesday it had acquired Taiwan's Wintek Bio-Science Inc, a distributor of veterinary products with about 25 employees.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were undisclosed.</p>
<p>IDEXX said in a statement the acquisition would assist its efforts to expand its Asia/Pacific business and that it plans to extend Wintek's activities into food and environmental markets.</p>
</text>
